WEBVTT

00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:11.061
Whoo!

00:00:13.438 --> 00:00:14.606
[Zee] Whoa!

00:00:18.276 --> 00:00:20.904
You took a big chance
giving yourself up back there.

00:00:20.988 --> 00:00:23.198
That's what you do in a herd.

00:00:23.281 --> 00:00:26.910
Besides, I knew you'd be the one
to come and rescue me.

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:31.915
So, what now?
I'm sure you have something in mind.

00:00:31.999 --> 00:00:34.167
How about we make it up as we go along?

00:00:34.251 --> 00:00:36.586
Now, that's what I call a plan.

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:37.879
-[thuds]
-[growls]

00:00:43.468 --> 00:00:46.013
-[Eddie] Whee-hee-hee-hoo!
-[Crash] Oh, yeah!

00:00:49.433 --> 00:00:51.852
-[Eddie] Whoa!
-[Crash laughs]

00:00:51.935 --> 00:00:53.478
[Eddie laughing]

00:00:54.271 --> 00:00:57.399
Okay, I'm confused. What just happened?

00:00:57.482 --> 00:01:00.652
I believe Crash and Eddie
just kicked some serious butt.

00:01:01.778 --> 00:01:02.779
[screams]

00:01:06.283 --> 00:01:07.409
[roars]

00:01:07.492 --> 00:01:10.412
-[laughs] Yeah!
-All right, Mama!

00:01:10.912 --> 00:01:12.247
Wait for me, guys!

00:01:12.331 --> 00:01:14.082
[roars]

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:19.713
[growls]

00:01:23.258 --> 00:01:24.301
Yes!

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:38.231
You've been nothing but
a thorn in my side from the start.

00:01:38.315 --> 00:01:40.859
You just never got it, Orson.

00:01:40.942 --> 00:01:43.779
The Lost World
isn't meant to be ruled by anyone.

00:01:43.862 --> 00:01:47.157
Not just anyone. Me! [shouts]

00:01:48.283 --> 00:01:49.368
En garde!

00:01:58.835 --> 00:02:00.712
All right, who wants some?

00:02:00.796 --> 00:02:02.130
Take this!

00:02:02.798 --> 00:02:04.716
And that! Huh?

00:02:05.509 --> 00:02:08.679
Time to get a little less mammoth
and a little more possum.

00:02:11.765 --> 00:02:14.977
All right! [screaming]

00:02:17.562 --> 00:02:19.439
Back off. He's family.

00:02:19.523 --> 00:02:21.775
Besides, he's high in saturated fats.

00:02:21.858 --> 00:02:25.278
Look, the truth is we all need each other.

00:02:25.362 --> 00:02:27.364
-[shouts]
-[groans]

00:02:27.447 --> 00:02:29.282
[panting]

00:02:29.366 --> 00:02:32.452
Down here, all creatures,
mammals and dinos alike,

00:02:32.995 --> 00:02:34.705
we need to live in harmony.

00:02:35.205 --> 00:02:37.624
Oh, you are so naive.

00:02:37.708 --> 00:02:39.960
This is why I feel sorry for you, Buck.

00:02:40.043 --> 00:02:41.545
You're too idealistic.

00:02:41.628 --> 00:02:45.924
In the real world, it's survival
of the fittest, or should I say smartest.

00:02:56.226 --> 00:02:58.228
Oh! Nailed it.

00:03:01.231 --> 00:03:03.567
-[spits]
-[nervous chuckle]

00:03:04.151 --> 00:03:05.902
Oh, no. [gasps]

00:03:11.241 --> 00:03:12.284
Sic 'em.

00:03:12.367 --> 00:03:13.368
Alley-oop!

00:03:15.662 --> 00:03:16.788
Stay! Down, boy.

00:03:16.872 --> 00:03:19.166
Bad dinos. No bite! No bite!

00:03:19.249 --> 00:03:20.709
Ha, croissant!

00:03:21.335 --> 00:03:23.086
[groaning]

00:03:23.170 --> 00:03:24.713
-Baguette!
-[groans]

00:03:24.796 --> 00:03:26.089
-Fromage!
-[gasps]

00:03:26.632 --> 00:03:28.342
Looks like you got me, Bucky.

00:03:29.176 --> 00:03:31.637
Or do you? [laughs]

00:03:31.720 --> 00:03:34.264
Seems I've outsmarted you once again.

00:03:34.348 --> 00:03:37.142
They're gonna tear
your little friends to pieces,

00:03:37.225 --> 00:03:39.936
and then they're gonna come for you.

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:42.105
Watch this, Buckmeinster.

00:03:43.273 --> 00:03:44.483
It's showtime.

00:03:48.487 --> 00:03:49.738
It's the fire!

00:03:49.821 --> 00:03:52.115
That's how he gets them
to follow his every move.

00:03:52.199 --> 00:03:55.952
Remember what Zee said?
The answer is in our chest fur.

00:04:11.718 --> 00:04:15.347
[both] Three. Two. One. Play dead.

00:04:16.098 --> 00:04:17.307
[both groan]

00:04:20.769 --> 00:04:22.145
[groans]

00:04:22.229 --> 00:04:25.482
Oh, come on, guys.
We're not falling for that.

00:04:25.565 --> 00:04:27.818
We didn't fall for it the first time.

00:04:37.119 --> 00:04:39.454
What? You imbeciles.

00:04:39.538 --> 00:04:41.915
You're raptors, not possums. Get up!

00:04:43.041 --> 00:04:44.751
-Oh, yeah!
-Whoo-hoo!

00:04:44.835 --> 00:04:46.295
Yeah!

00:04:46.378 --> 00:04:48.463
-Those are my boys!
-Whoo!

00:04:48.547 --> 00:04:50.632
Yes! Well done, lads!

00:04:50.716 --> 00:04:52.884
That's called using your spleens!

00:04:52.968 --> 00:04:57.014
Ha, what do you know, Eddie?
We do have a superpower.

00:04:57.097 --> 00:04:58.849
-Yeah!
-Playing dead!

00:04:58.932 --> 00:05:00.267
What?

00:05:00.350 --> 00:05:03.061
[laughs]
Looks like you've been outsmarted.

00:05:03.145 --> 00:05:05.439
No, no, no, no, no, no, no-- [screams]

00:05:06.148 --> 00:05:08.025
-[Orson shouting]
-[Penelope screeches]

00:05:09.401 --> 00:05:10.444
[shouts]

00:05:10.527 --> 00:05:12.070
[roars]

00:05:12.154 --> 00:05:14.573
[screams]

00:05:14.656 --> 00:05:17.868
[groaning]

00:05:18.368 --> 00:05:20.662
Uh… I'm okay!

00:05:21.538 --> 00:05:22.748
[small mammal] Think again.

00:05:23.373 --> 00:05:25.500
-[large mammal] Payback time.
-[large mammal 2] Oh, yeah.

00:05:27.419 --> 00:05:29.630
Where's your chew toy? Go get him.

00:05:29.713 --> 00:05:30.797
[gasps]

00:05:31.757 --> 00:05:35.636
[yelps] What? I don't know
if you got the memo. I'm your king.

00:05:35.719 --> 00:05:37.804
I command you-- [shouts]

00:05:37.888 --> 00:05:40.307
Oh, whoa! That was close.
Hey, please don't eat me.

00:05:40.390 --> 00:05:42.684
You'll be depriving the world
of a great genius.

00:05:42.768 --> 00:05:45.646
I'm full of tiny bones
that'll get stuck in your throat.

00:05:46.146 --> 00:05:48.565
What have I told you about boundaries?

00:05:51.401 --> 00:05:53.779
Boys, that was a fine job.

00:05:54.279 --> 00:05:57.199
[as Lefty] Better than fine.
I'd say super, even.

00:05:57.282 --> 00:05:59.785
You made this old weasel proud.

00:05:59.868 --> 00:06:01.203
[as Lefty] Who are you calling old?

00:06:01.286 --> 00:06:04.081
-[chuckles]
-[Ellie] Crash! Eddie!

